<p>Page Type: SCP Article</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch: A set of twin beds that allow teleportation in between them. Sleeping in one bed will cause you to wake up in the other, regardless of distance between the two. The sleeper feels no change during the night, and cameras and surveillance of the bed during transport show the sleeper just vanishing.</p>
<p>Central Narrative: None.</p>
<p>Hook/Attention-Grabber: A bed used by the foundation to transport quickly across long distances.</p>
<p>Additional Notes: Not an extremely deep entry, but I just think it sounds good.</p>

